# VContainer `[Inject]` Construct Methods

`Construct` (or other `[Inject]` methods) are called once by the container. Do not guard against repeated injection:

- No `if (_dependency != null)` checks before assignment
- No preliminary unsubscriptions before subscribing in `Construct`

Unsubscribe from events in `OnDestroy` (or equivalent teardown), not preemptively in `Construct`.

```csharp
// BAD
[Inject]
public void Construct(GemsSystem gemsSystem)
{
    if (_gemsSystem != null)
        _gemsSystem.GemCollected -= OnGemCollected;

    _gemsSystem = gemsSystem;
    _gemsSystem.GemCollected += OnGemCollected;
}

// GOOD
[Inject]
public void Construct(GemsSystem gemsSystem)
{
    _gemsSystem = gemsSystem;
    _gemsSystem.GemCollected += OnGemCollected;
}

private void OnDestroy()
{
    _gemsSystem.GemCollected -= OnGemCollected;
}
```
